{"id":4465,"date":"2025-05-20T12:26:46","date_gmt":"2025-05-20T11:26:46","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/?p=4465"},"modified":"2025-06-06T10:08:16","modified_gmt":"2025-06-06T09:08:16","slug":"the-portal-trust-supports-ccac","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/the-portal-trust-supports-ccac\/","title":{"rendered":"The Portal Trust supports CCAC co-design expansion across Inner London Boroughs"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<div class=\"wp-block-stackable-image stk-block-image stk-block stk-7fe81cb\" data-block-id=\"7fe81cb\"><style>.stk-7fe81cb {margin-bottom:5px !important;}<\/style><figure><span class=\"stk-img-wrapper stk-image--shape-stretch\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"stk-img wp-image-4466 lazyload\" data-src=\"https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/Drawing.jpg\" width=\"1379\" height=\"969\" data-srcset=\"https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/Drawing.jpg 1379w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/Drawing-300x211.jpg 300w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/Drawing-1024x720.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/Drawing-768x540.jpg 768w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/Drawing-285x200.jpg 285w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/Drawing-178x125.jpg 178w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 1379px) 100vw, 1379px\" src=\"data:image\/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMSIgaGVpZ2h0PSIxIiB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciPjwvc3ZnPg==\" style=\"--smush-placeholder-width: 1379px; --smush-placeholder-aspect-ratio: 1379\/969;\" \/><\/span><\/figure><\/div>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center has-small-font-size wp-block-paragraph\"><span style=\"color: #666666;\" class=\"stk-highlight\">Proposals to mitigate and overcome a flooded Clapham envisaged by a child team at Clapham Manor Primary School, London. Notice the school is centre stage.<\/span><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>The Portal Trust and CCAC are collaborating to launch a new London primary school cluster in 2026.<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">CCAC\u2019s partnerships with primary schools to date have largely been opportunistic. Whilst this has produced brilliant and rewarding co-design projects in primary schools across the country, we need to ensure that the most diverse and underserved schools are benefitting from the same opportunity. Inclusivity and diversity are critical to CCAC\u2019s mission.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">We are delighted that <a href=\"https:\/\/portaltrust.org\/\">The Portal Trus<\/a>t has committed to assisting this objective. Together, we will establish a four-school cluster in the fourteen Inner London Boroughs they support, expanding our co-design programme to four diverse primary schools in the capital. The process will be closely monitored and reviewed to allow us to synthesise CCAC\u2019s approach to finding schools and securing co-design programmes in the future. We intend to use this launch to further consolidate and expand our school coverage and set a precedent for similar CCAC hubs in other UK cities.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-stackable-image stk-block-image stk-block stk-94eb743\" data-block-id=\"94eb743\"><style>.stk-94eb743 {margin-bottom:5px !important;}<\/style><figure><span class=\"stk-img-wrapper stk-image--shape-stretch\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"stk-img wp-image-4467 lazyload\" data-src=\"https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/The-Bemrose.jpg\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1280\" data-srcset=\"https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/The-Bemrose.jpg 1920w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/The-Bemrose-300x200.jpg 300w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/The-Bemrose-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/The-Bemrose-768x512.jpg 768w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/The-Bemrose-1536x1024.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/The-Bemrose-188x125.jpg 188w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 1920px) 100vw, 1920px\" src=\"data:image\/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMSIgaGVpZ2h0PSIxIiB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciPjwvc3ZnPg==\" style=\"--smush-placeholder-width: 1920px; --smush-placeholder-aspect-ratio: 1920\/1280;\" \/><\/span><\/figure><\/div>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center has-small-font-size wp-block-paragraph\"><span style=\"color: #666666;\" class=\"stk-highlight\">Children at The Bemrose Primary School creating designs as part of their co-design project with architect Polly North titled \u2018Farms of the Future\u2019.<\/span><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">The Portal Trust supports great ideas that empower young people in London to discover their full potential. As a charity, it funds, supports and contributes to organisations, groups and individuals that deliver impactful educational opportunities. With over 270 years of experience, it is one of London\u2019s leading educational charities. CCAC is grateful for The Portal Trust\u2019s support and looks forward to working together to deliver inclusive, impactful and innovative educational opportunities.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Schools and designers will be assembled in autumn 2025 and the new co-design projects launched in Spring 2026.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-stackable-image aligncenter stk-block-image stk-block stk-be24555\" data-block-id=\"be24555\"><style>.stk-be24555 .stk-img-wrapper{width:49% !important;height:245px !important;}<\/style><figure><span class=\"stk-img-wrapper stk-image--shape-stretch\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"stk-img wp-image-4468 lazyload\" data-src=\"https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/The-Portal-Trust_Beneficiary-Logo_CMYK.jpg\" width=\"49\" height=\"245\" src=\"data:image\/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMSIgaGVpZ2h0PSIxIiB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciPjwvc3ZnPg==\" style=\"--smush-placeholder-width: 49px; --smush-placeholder-aspect-ratio: 49\/245;\" \/><\/span><\/figure><\/div>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>The Portal Trust and CCAC are collaborating to launch a new London primary school cluster in 2026.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":9,"featured_media":4466,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"_acf_changed":false,"footnotes":""},"categories":[12],"tags":[],"class_list":["post-4465","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","category-ccac-news"],"acf":[],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO plugin v28.5 - https:\/\/yoast.com\/product\/yoast-seo-wordpress\/ -->\n<title>The Portal Trust supports CCAC co-design expansion across Inner London Boroughs - Climate Change All Change<\/title>\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\" \/>\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/the-portal-trust-supports-ccac\/\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_GB\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"The Portal Trust supports CCAC co-design expansion across Inner London Boroughs - Climate Change All Change\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"The Portal Trust and CCAC are collaborating to launch a new London primary school cluster in 2026.\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/the-portal-trust-supports-ccac\/\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"Climate Change All Change\" \/>\n<meta property=\"article:published_time\" content=\"2025-05-20T11:26:46+00:00\" \/>\n<meta property=\"article:modified_time\" content=\"2025-06-06T09:08:16+00:00\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/Drawing.jpg